                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c4785e7-34e3-3206-97ec-928d6966841f",
                                        "entry_id": "ed3564ae-189f-3285-8576-cd999efa4bc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which has a distinct existence as an individual unit, often used for organizations which have no physical form."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "449ec52c-60ad-41c9-897c-72d7fe7f8a51",
                                                "sense_id": "8c4785e7-34e3-3206-97ec-928d6966841f",
                                                "text": "The organisational and administrative tasks involved in welding the railways into a single entity have also received much publicity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6972351c-056b-498f-b80f-b35ba6d48c44",
                                                "sense_id": "8c4785e7-34e3-3206-97ec-928d6966841f",
                                                "text": "It is also pertinent to note that the current obvious decline in work on holarctic hepatics most surely reflects a current obsession with cataloging and with nomenclature of the organisms—as divorced from their study as living entities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "467ced42-4209-4267-8c34-160b0316b7b8",
                                                "sense_id": "8c4785e7-34e3-3206-97ec-928d6966841f",
                                                "text": "Weinersmith, who is best known for his webcomic Saturday Morning Breakfast Cereal, describes the polystate as a geopolitical entity in which multiple overlapping states exist — but each “state” consists of citizens who have agreed to the laws of a single non-geographic state; typical geographically-bound nations, or traditional “geostates”, would be replaced by “polystates”, which are collections of “anthrostates”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17a8ce62-6251-4013-a8f3-70338f3a0457",
                                                "sense_id": "8c4785e7-34e3-3206-97ec-928d6966841f",
                                                "text": "The monitor overseeing the Trump Organization’s finances wrote in its latest report that Donald Trump’s company intends to create 25 new entities for products or hotel licensing deals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7d436e6-b11c-35ce-bbf8-42f0a05d3d4b",
                                        "entry_id": "ed3564ae-189f-3285-8576-cd999efa4bc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The existence of something considered apart from its properties."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d26933bb-1642-3610-8e79-2c72a81384b1",
                                        "entry_id": "ed3564ae-189f-3285-8576-cd999efa4bc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything about which information or data can be stored in a database; in particular, one item in an organised array or set of individual elements or parts of the same type."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "599eb22e-55f5-32a2-897d-00c48d16aa11",
                                        "entry_id": "ed3564ae-189f-3285-8576-cd999efa4bc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state or quality of being or existence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e17b0313-71f5-4bb9-b284-e13d3e0a464b",
                                                "sense_id": "599eb22e-55f5-32a2-897d-00c48d16aa11",
                                                "text": "The group successfully maintains its tribal entity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f47572f8-563d-369f-9a89-51b5e6af9e1b",
                                        "entry_id": "ed3564ae-189f-3285-8576-cd999efa4bc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A spirit, ghost, or the like."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18817b73-a7b3-4c2b-9cd1-5f2f93355fea",
                                                "sense_id": "f47572f8-563d-369f-9a89-51b5e6af9e1b",
                                                "text": "[B]ut only too often séances degenerate into pure sorcery or necromancy, attracting all kinds of undeveloped and earth-bound entities."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae0fbb6f-caab-3210-bebf-6845fec21532",
                                        "entry_id": "ed3564ae-189f-3285-8576-cd999efa4bc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An alien lifeform that has no corporeal body."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
